   "tagline": "An interactive studio of the **Montessori early-math materials** for Maria Montessori's **156th birthday** (born 31 Aug 1870 at Chiaravalle, Italy — she opened the first *Casa dei Bambini* in Rome's San Lorenzo slum on 6 Jan 1907). The pedagogy is famous; what this studio catalogues is the **exact arithmetic hiding inside the materials**, because every one of them is a closed form you can hold:",
