   "tagline": "A **lighthouse light-characteristic builder** for National Lighthouse Day (August 7). Every lighthouse has a coded flash signature — its *nightmark* — charted in [IALA notation](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Light_characteristic), like `Fl(2) W 6s` or `Mo(A) W 6s`. The rhythm, color, and cycle length together let a sailor read a beacon out of the dark and know exactly which one it is.",
